    "body": "---\ntitle: \"PRIZMA: Content production as a service for online retailers and manufacturers\"\ndescription: \"PRIZMA takes over your ongoing content production: posts, reels, carousels, SEO articles and AI avatar videos from your product data, published under your approval rules. With a fixed monthly scope.\"\nimage: \"https://prizma.to/og-image.png\"\n---\n\n# Imprint (Impressum)\n\nLast updated: July 2026\n\nThis imprint is provided pursuant to German law (§ 5 DDG). In case of any discrepancy, the [German version](/de/impressum) prevails.\n\n## Information pursuant to § 5 DDG\n\n**Igor Zelikovsky**\nDigitalkin AI (trade name)\nBleicherfeldstraße 31\n33689 Bielefeld\nGermany\n\n## Contact\n\nPhone: [+49 521 96377655](tel:+4952196377655) (AI assistant)\nEmail: [contact@digitalkin.co](mailto:contact@digitalkin.co)\n\n## Responsible for content pursuant to § 18 (2) MStV\n\nIgor Zelikovsky (address as above)\nEmail: [contact@digitalkin.co](mailto:contact@digitalkin.co)\n\n## Disclaimer\n\nThe contents of this website have been created with the greatest possible care. However, we assume no liability for the accuracy, completeness and timeliness of the content.\n\n## Copyright\n\nThe content and works created by the site operator on this website are subject to German copyright law. Reproduction, adaptation, distribution and any kind of exploitation outside the limits of copyright law require the written consent of the respective author or creator.\n\n## Consumer dispute resolution\n\nWe are neither willing nor obliged to participate in dispute resolution proceedings before a consumer arbitration board.\n",
