    "body": "---\ntitle: \"PRIZMA: Content production as a service for online retailers and manufacturers\"\ndescription: \"PRIZMA takes over your ongoing content production: posts, reels, carousels, SEO articles and AI avatar videos from your product data, published under your approval rules. With a fixed monthly scope.\"\nimage: \"https://prizma.to/og-image.png\"\n---\n\n# Data deletion\n\nLast updated: October 2026\n\nPrizma processes comments and messages from Facebook and Instagram on behalf of the businesses that use it. Details are in section 9 of our [Privacy Policy](/en/privacy).\n\n## If you commented on or wrote to a business that uses Prizma\n\nEmail [contact@digitalkin.co](mailto:contact@digitalkin.co?subject=Data%20deletion) with the subject \"Data deletion\". Include your Facebook name or Instagram username and, if you know it, the name of the business.\n\nWithin 30 days we delete your comments, your messages and the contact details taken from them, and confirm this by email. If the business has already received your enquiry in its own CRM, deleting it there is up to the business. We forward your request to it.\n\n## If you connected your business account to Prizma\n\nTo disconnect Facebook or Instagram, write to [contact@digitalkin.co](mailto:contact@digitalkin.co?subject=Disconnect) and we will do it the same working day. You can also remove our app yourself in your Facebook or Instagram settings under \"Apps and websites\". In both cases the comments, messages and access tokens of your account are deleted automatically within 30 days.\n\nWhen you remove the app in Facebook, Facebook sends us a deletion request and shows you a confirmation code. If you have questions about your request, write to [contact@digitalkin.co](mailto:contact@digitalkin.co?subject=Data%20deletion) and include the code. To have the data deleted sooner than 30 days, write to the same address.\n\n## If you connected LinkedIn to Prizma\n\nDisconnect LinkedIn in Prizma, or remove Prizma in LinkedIn under Settings, Data privacy, Permitted services. We delete the tokens immediately after a disconnect in Prizma and the other LinkedIn data within 7 days, or within 30 days after removal in LinkedIn. Details are in section 11 of our [Privacy Policy](/en/privacy).\n\n## Contact\n\nIgor Zelikovsky, Digitalkin AI\nBleicherfeldstraße 31, 33689 Bielefeld, Germany\n[contact@digitalkin.co](mailto:contact@digitalkin.co)\n",
